Package: seminrjamovi
Type: Package
Title: seminr for jamovi
Version: 0.1.0
Author: André Calero Valdez <andrecalerovaldez@gmail.com>
Maintainer: André Calero Valdez <andrecalerovaldez@gmail.com>
Description: A wrapper around the seminr package to provide Partial Least
    Squares Structural Equation Modeling (PLS-SEM) features in jamovi.
    Allows users to specify measurement models, structural models, and
    run PLS-SEM analyses with optional bootstrapping for inference.
